WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.535
-Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.603
"The Tonight Show."
You're here.

00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:05.871
Thank you for watching at home.

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:09.008
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:10.543
Let's get to some news.

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.578
Guys, today, the Senate approved

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:15.848 line:0%
President Biden's
$3.5 trillion budget

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:17.584 line:0%
for housing, education...
-Whoo!

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:19.219 line:0%
-...healthcare,
and the environment.

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:23.489 line:0%
Yeah, that's giant.
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:25.491
$3.5 trillion.

00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:28.228
Biden's spending money like his
Gap Rewards just kicked in.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:29.729
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:33.466
Yeah, Biden calls it
the human infrastructure plan.

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.968
Not really crazy about the term
human infrastructure.

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:38.037
[ Laughter ]
I'm picturing rich couples

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.705
using other people as furniture,
you know?

00:00:39.705 --> 00:00:41.273
[ Laughter ]
It's like, "We picked him up

00:00:41.273 --> 00:00:42.342
in upstate New York."

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:43.943
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.211
Meanwhile, the Biden
administration

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.146
has also been quietly
discussing a plan

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:51.651 line:0%
to wean airlines
off fossil fuels by 2050.

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:53.553
-Whoo!
-By that time, all planes

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.287
will now be running
on Hard Mountain Dew.

00:00:55.287 --> 00:00:57.390
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.559
-Yeehaw!
-And the pilots, too.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.161
[ Laughter ]
Yep, airlines will start using

00:01:02.161 --> 00:01:04.130
renewable energy,
like cooking oil.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.398
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:06.833
So not only is it good
for the environment,

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.535
but every plane
will smell like Popeye's.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:09.869
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:11.937
-Whoo! [ Claps ]
-It's a win-win.

00:01:11.937 --> 00:01:13.807
Speaking of airlines,
I heard that Southwest,

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.708
American, and Delta Airlines

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.744
will not require employees
to be vaccinated.

00:01:18.744 --> 00:01:20.079
[ Grumbling ]

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:22.916
Odd twist -- Frontier is now
the classy airline.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.784
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:27.020
Didn't see that one coming.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.255
[ English accent ]
I prefer the 3M duct tape,
please. Thank you.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:33.426
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:36.129
I mean, come on, Delta,
you have the exact name --

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:38.464
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:40.399
-Come on!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:41.500
-What are you...?

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:45.071
[ Applause continues ]

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:47.006
It probably explains
their new slogan,

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:49.341 line:0%
"Delta -- Making Corona
hold our beer."

00:01:49.341 --> 00:01:50.843 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:53.012
-Why would they do that?

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:54.080
-Well, here's some good news --

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.748
the CDC says
we're now averaging

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:59.985 line:0%
500,000 vaccinations per day
for the first time since June.

00:01:59.985 --> 00:02:01.921 line:0%
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:02.989
That's great.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.223
[ Whistling ]

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:06.659
[ Applause continues ]

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:08.561
You know, that's crazy.
500,000 people

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:09.896
are getting vaccinated
every day,

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:11.196
despite what all the experts

00:02:11.196 --> 00:02:12.765
