you know?

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:14.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:17.269
This is a little strange.
I read this --

00:02:17.269 --> 00:02:21.240
Rudy Giuliani has joined Cameo
and is selling videos

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:24.243
