Hello, this is Rudy Giuliani.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.749
I want to wish Deez Nuts
a happy retirement.

00:02:30.749 --> 00:02:32.951
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:32.951 --> 00:02:33.953
I knew you'd dig that.

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:38.291
[Rimshot]

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:39.759
If you're wondering what
a birthday message

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:41.127
from Rudy Giuliani looks like,

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:42.995 line:0%
it's pretty much what you'd
expect. Take a look.

00:02:42.995 --> 00:02:44.497 line:0%
-Hello, Bill,
it's Rudy Giuliani

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:47.800 line:0%
and I'm wishing you
a happy birthday.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.669 line:0%
Never remember
a censorship like this.

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.771
The hard drive, the election,

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:54.674
