00:03:00.212 --> 00:03:05.785
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:07.486
-It's easy.
Just tell your eight-year-old

00:03:07.486 --> 00:03:08.621
"I was going to get you Shaq,

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:10.490
